    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up with these crazy hives all over my arms and chest... i think it might be my seasonal allergies acting up since everything is blooming right now. my throat feels a little tight too like maybe some swelling from the pollen? should i just take an extra dose of my loratadine or do i need to go see someone?",
